WEBVTT

00:00:01.703 --> 00:00:07.025
Ladies and gentlemen, the data center bidding war begins! Highest bid wins!

00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:10.005
Huh? We have to attend a thing like this?

00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:13.654
Our bid sheet. Right here.

00:00:13.654 --> 00:00:17.023
Zero?! Is that a joke?

00:00:17.023 --> 00:00:23.039
Not a joke. Arithmetic. Build it, and the rent is forever.

00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:30.475
Our data center is in that closet. The plug is ours too.

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:36.051
So the rent is zero.

